摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness eDEX-UI shell plugin — JARVIS variant: electric cyan HUD with VITAL SIGNS / RT-MONITOR / RT-LOG left bar, POWER CORE / RADAR right bar, JARVIS header","id":"gh:1345751453","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-edex-jarvis-ui","slug":"ph4310822/dsh-edex-jarvis-ui","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness eDEX-UI shell plugin — JARVIS variant: electric cyan HUD with VITAL SIGNS / RT-MONI"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"TOR / RT-LOG left bar, POWER CORE / RADAR right bar, JARVIS header"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-edex-jarvis-ui"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**DeepSeek Harness eDEX-UI shell plugin — JARVIS variant** — a sci-fi HUD shell\nfor the DSH web GUI "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"themed after a JARVIS dashboard reference: electric cyan\n(`#1ac7e2`) on near-black, thin 1px cyan ca"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"rd rectangles with subtle glow, and\na JARVIS header strip. The original UI stays centered and fully "},{"id":"p3s4","text":"s with subtle glow, and\na JARVIS header strip. The original UI stays centered and fully interactive."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **JARVIS header strip** — `JARVIS` brand, `SYSTEM STATUS: OPTIMAL` with a\nglowing status dot, and "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"a live `LOCAL TIME` readout\n- **Left bar** — three floating cards:\n- **VITAL SIGNS** — live clock, h"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"eart rate `72 BPM` with an animated ECG\npulse line, activity bars, `BODY TEMP` / `NEURAL LINK: ACTIV"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"E`\n- **RT-MONITOR** — glowing `CPU LOAD` / `MEMORY` / `STORAGE` progress rows\nwith live host telemet"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"ry\n- **RT-LOG** — rolling timestamped event log (`SYSTEM INTEGRITY CHECK`,\n`BIO-SYNC STABLE`, `DEFEN"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"SE PERIMETER ACTIVE`)\n- **Right bar** — three floating cards:\n- **POWER CORE** — `POWER CORE 98%` / "},{"id":"p5s7","text":"`STRUCTURAL 100%` gauges, live\n`SIGNAL` bar, and a `DEFENSE SYSTEMS` grid of 4 toggleable buttons\n(S"},{"id":"p5s8","text":"HIELD / LASER / EMP / MISSILE)\n- **RADAR** — the featured widget (replaces the WORLD VIEW globe): a\n"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"circular scan disc with dashed outer ring, concentric rings, crosshair,\ndiagonal radial guides, `COR"},{"id":"p5s10","text":"E ACTIVE` core module, and a rotating conic\nsweep\n- **TRAFFIC** — dual up/down throughput chart\n- **"},{"id":"p5s11","text":"Bottom panel** — filesystem browser (DIR), file preview/editor, and a\n**JARVIS console** terminal (`"},{"id":"p5s12","text":"jarvis` welcome banner, real host shell via\n`systemMetrics.runCommand`)\n- **Card language** — every "},{"id":"p5s13","text":"widget card is a full 1px cyan rectangle with\nsharp corners and a subtle glow, floating with gaps ov"},{"id":"p5s14","text":"er the near-black\ncanvas; panels themselves recede into the background\n- **Cyan-on-black skin** — to"},{"id":"p5s15","text":"ken overrides recolor the entire original UI to\nthe JARVIS electric cyan, without touching the user'"},{"id":"p5s16","text":"s theme preference\n- **Workspace preserved** — the DSH sidebar, conversation, and composer render\nin"},{"id":"p5s17","text":" the center region; the card chrome never occludes them"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The plugin is published to npm as `@danielng23/dsh-edex-jarvis-ui`. From the\nharness checkout:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"To run the local checkout instead of the npm release (for development), add\nthe bundle with a `file:"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"the local checkout instead of the npm release (for development), add\nthe bundle with a `file:` path:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"See LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md for the build, install, and\niteration workflow. The widget architecture for"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" the shell bars is documented\nin WIDGETS.md; the theme derivation and widget reconciliation\nare reco"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"rded in analysis.md."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Packages"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Package | Host/Client | Description |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| `packages/bundle` | — | Installable bundle (`cordis.patch.yml`) |\n| `packages/ui-edex` | client | "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"The eDEX shell frame and all panels |\n| `packages/ui-theme-terminal` | client | Appearance → Termina"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"l theme row |\n| `packages/host/system-metrics` | host | System telemetry RPC + file read/write + `ru"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"nCommand` shell execution |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
